Generate Wireshark Lua dissectors from YAML protocol descriptions

Usage: wirdigen [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  validate  Validate Protocol Descriptions; write nothing
  generate  Validate Protocol Descriptions and write their Dissectors
  schema    Print the JSON Schema of Protocol Descriptions, for editor completion
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --color <COLOR>
          When to colour Diagnostics on stderr

          Possible values:
          - auto:   Colour when stderr is a terminal, unless `NO_COLOR` or `CLICOLOR_FORCE` says otherwise
          - always: Always colour
          - never:  Never colour
          
          [default: auto]

  -q, --quiet
          Hide warnings and the summary line; errors are still shown

  -v, --verbose
          List each Dissector as written or unchanged

      --message-format <MESSAGE_FORMAT>
          How to report Diagnostics and results: `human` on stderr, or `json` Lines on stdout

          Possible values:
          - human: Rendered Diagnostics and status lines on stderr
          - json:  One JSON object per line on stdout: `diagnostic`, `file` and `summary` records
          
          [default: human]

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')

  -V, --version
          Print version
